Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish If you want it,\Ngotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,no Cause I'm aiming to get there\Nfirst, yeah It's all or nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,no time to worry Do it later,\Nright now I'm living free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you It
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that, to run is not\Nan option Once they're closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the satisfaction\NYou think I'm rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,here's my appreciation When\Nthings are getting tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,just gotta smile
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way\NAnd you're looking for a fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,brand new day Then make sure your\Nonly thought you have is Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way Marks\Nmaps will be made Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With every step that you will\Ntake. Just look at all you've been
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,through Look ahead to new horizons\NIn view shining brightly Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows what's waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way\NMake like a hurricane Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,got to make your mark today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish Your dreams don't run away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They nailed him in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Hold 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang on tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:02:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General Hold 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How was a headliner taken\Nout with a single blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has power like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Toto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if things get ugly,\Nthe girl's in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner we get back, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let them get away with the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No food means no feast for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Might get a little rocky here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging on as tight as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You do what you've got to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chop them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH\NUGHHH MOVE IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,UGHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta catch up to everyone and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want them eating all the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use that to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's back there manhandling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddy up, horsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, she's a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you ride General Speed like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull them off of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hand me your miscreant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama, make me a dog dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No questions, just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was delicious! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, master, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess being half a horse counts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with General\NSpeed? Go! After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Horselita!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch up to that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You watch your mouth, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And just what kind of\Nnickname is Horselina?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to listen to Big\NBro, Horselina! Ready, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you desire, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine why\NGeneral Speed would switch
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,sides and join the enemy\Nout of nowhere like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if these guys\Nhave some dirt on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Hawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, the punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just like Ace back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeehee!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach him a lesson! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And those tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They formed an alliance, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At least Roro Noah's with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows about our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't wrap my head around\Nwhy they'd fight Hold 'em, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General Hold 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we must report this to Master Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This better be the last thing they screw\Nup Or else our plan is going down in flames
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, Hawkins
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, somebody, you have to\Nhelp me. Oh, where did my legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Oh, how the hell is this\Nlower body moving all on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning straw sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.16,0:09:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar law.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You've certainly caused me\Nsome trouble, but not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running your mouth, coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Amputation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And shims
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you destroyed my proxies you certainly can\Nthink on your feet i was bluffing earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,i am a doctor not a killer seems\Nyou'll live another day welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to the land of wano we've not\Ncrossed paths in sub odi i assume you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't come here for leisure not\Nwhen your alliance is in country too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are you surprised by my knowing i\Nhappened upon the Straw Hats earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,i suppose your plan was to silence\Nme before you were discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Jack knows they're\Nreally screwing this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender, Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever scheme you were\Nconcealing is not going to pan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But Commander Kaido will\Nnot be happy to learn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of your appalling\Nactions in his territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the worst possible\Nthing that could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to get\Nhit, then get out of our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole room, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, but we need\Nto come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our food supply there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't old Traffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a problem, Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are you the most\Nwanted person in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But now Jack's on to you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to the promise\Nyou made about keeping a low profile?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And another thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in Curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to be a\Nronin in the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I had any choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I ran into Luffy, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you causing trouble already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He just got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Soto-Judo, we're at the town's edge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Next stop is Okobore town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, I'm still so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a treasure barge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of school!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, find it in your heart to look down\Nupon us and grant him just a bit of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle just rolled into town!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been spared!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, come and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too good to be\Ntrue! I'm speechless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure that everyone gets their bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I could cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your filthy hands off that\Nfood, you bunch of riffraff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our treasure, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Step away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You think just for some delicious food\Nwheels into town, it belongs to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How quickly you've forgotten your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another step forward Siding with the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Poppers, then? You fool!\NThere will be consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:16:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you something Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clean water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.56,0:17:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember the last time\Nwe had this much drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My prayers didn't fall on deaf ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Luffy Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone asks, tell them I helped ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What you just did is considered\Na rebellion against all of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.14,0:18:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an apple!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is payback for the\Nrice bowl you made for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And, hey, there will be more, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All this meat is really for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:18:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You better leave me some of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the flames are spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the firefighters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Holden, please, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the lion still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Trafalgar Law, and Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize admitting this doesn't\Nreflect well upon my performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:20:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but handling all three of them at once\Nproved a bit beyond my capabilities. Kahlik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep eating, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my best birthday ever,\Nand it's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, this feast isn't special.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make this a normal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that by the time we leave Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be a place where you can\Neat as much as you want every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I gotta leave now, but\NI promise that we'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want this to be a place\Nwhere you can eat every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just super happy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,what a pain you're really screwed up these\Nguys will be on our asses for real now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so get ready yeah let's try to stay out\Nof trouble you guys he's talking to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the point still stands though\Nlet's get moving follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll head to the ruins of odin\Ncastle it's at the top of the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'm ready to go home. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now protect her, Horselina. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's still not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Speed, a proud headliner\Nof the Beast Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't take orders\Nfrom the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to protect my\Nmaster because it's my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is an enemy headliner\Nfollowing that brat's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, big bro. Yeah? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, there's something\NI want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had such good food in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.98,0:23:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget this. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When I make it home to Amigasa Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to surprise my\Nmaster with this apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hi to Grandpa Nose for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you when I bring your dog back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good puppy and help\NBig Bro for me, okay? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.98,0:23:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need to borrow this sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't pass as a samurai\Nwithout one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even use it\Nthe right way, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.36,0:23:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see it already. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my master now! Great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to cut this short.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.28,0:23:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go whenever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fare thee well, and take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we will! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.06,0:24:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.82,0:24:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.02,0:24:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Taro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.58,0:24:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the most food I ever, ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.44,0:24:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandfather's out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.32,0:24:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd live to see the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our son is so healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll see ya
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.50,0:25:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise you'll return!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates doing nice crap for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.66,0:25:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We did good work today!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.46,0:25:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was still robbery, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.46,0:25:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess she didn't tame\Nyou with her Tang, huh, puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you want to explain\Nwhy you're tagging along, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.58,0:25:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness, please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.24,0:25:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I didn't mean to be intrusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.94,0:26:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see Odin Castle\Nup close, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.78,0:26:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.96,0:26:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku's a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's really strong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.48,0:26:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, why are we going\Nto this castle, Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can even call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.34,0:26:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.25,0:26:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What business do they have there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.06,0:26:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Only deserted ruins remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.56,0:26:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Taro seems to be trustworthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but I cannot lower my guard quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we got to Wano, we met\Nwith some allies and then set
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a couple of things in motion\Nanyway you'll see soon enough
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.38,0:26:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,right now we're going to meet\Nthe ghosts of the land of Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.66,0:26:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not going to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:27:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,this yeah it surprised me too
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.70,0:27:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your entire reality is about\Nto get turned upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.74,0:27:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll talk once we get to\Nthe ruins of Odin Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.62,0:27:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to see it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.42,0:27:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys feel that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.82,0:27:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's one of Orochi's assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.44,0:27:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.38,0:27:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.24,0:27:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.94,0:28:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught a whiff of\Nthat bloodlust of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.00,0:28:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.54,0:28:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle?! Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.74,0:28:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I said ruins. Oh yeah.\NIt's this way. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she went to go check up on Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole place is kind of creepy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.68,0:28:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because no one's\Nlived here in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.56,0:29:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.94,0:29:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden, you should take a\Nlook at the other tombstones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.80,0:29:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.86,0:29:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke it belongs to that brat kind\Nof hard to believe isn't it huh Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you joking with me, Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the only one you know, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.00,0:29:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.52,0:29:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.78,0:29:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.02,0:29:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they all have graves here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:29:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.24,0:30:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That just reminded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.88,0:30:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't been able to get\Nin touch with them yet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.10,0:30:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.92,0:30:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.84,0:30:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did everyone really get\Nthat far ahead of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.24,0:30:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.86,0:31:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.50,0:31:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.98,0:31:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Keenemon's supposed\Nto be waiting here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.64,0:31:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, he's been gone\Nfor quite a while. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.38,0:31:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe you'll see him this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.78,0:31:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He did appear in the\Ndead of night yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.08,0:31:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you making it sound\Nlike he's a ghost, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.08,0:31:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain this grave crap to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.04,0:31:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out already, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.04,0:31:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is there something you're hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.14,0:31:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I really shouldn't be\Nthe one to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.44,0:31:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hrrrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.84,0:32:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hrrrrrrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.48,0:32:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.82,0:32:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Salutations!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.94,0:32:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're still alive, Key!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.66,0:32:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was unable to retrieve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.78,0:32:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm delighted to see\Nyou're in good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been struck with a\Nviolent case of the trots
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.70,0:32:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,during another sleepless\Nnight in the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.56,0:32:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But luckily, I'm recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.60,0:32:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My stomach has chosen\Npeace for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.36,0:32:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Although rough, I live to see today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you make it sound like he died?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.24,0:32:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that impression?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.06,0:32:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What I meant was maybe he'd\Ncome out of the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.82,0:32:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that on purpose, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King! Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.92,0:32:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I last saw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've finally returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbraided breath I've waited!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.04,0:33:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have you been back anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.34,0:33:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did you not inform\Nme that you had returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.12,0:33:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your silence is cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried! Apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.18,0:33:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Lord Momonosuke alright as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.22,0:33:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.34,0:33:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Samoma's alive, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, those two knew each other all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.44,0:33:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem close, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, how did you become acquainted\Nwith Sir Luffy and his companions? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a coincidence. Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.88,0:33:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.14,0:33:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's quite a bit to relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.04,0:33:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They are allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.74,0:33:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Know them well, for I've recruited\Nthem to join our side in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy and Sir Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.80,0:33:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.68,0:33:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.86,0:33:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:34:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be pleased to know I was just\Npracticing techniques with my blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.12,0:34:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.28,0:34:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.88,0:34:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.84,0:34:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did old dog guy make it to\N102, Momo? Tell me. Huh? Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't speak to a lord\Nlike him so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.48,0:34:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.96,0:34:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.50,0:34:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.76,0:34:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, yes, Dogstorm has\Narrived safely as well. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're just waiting on my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.76,0:34:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.44,0:34:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs are tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.36,0:34:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us to look for ruins atop a mountain,\Nso with any luck, this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.28,0:34:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we were able to\Nget in touch with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.94,0:34:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.28,0:34:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.10,0:34:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.76,0:34:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.64,0:34:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sight to see! It is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.22,0:35:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.13,0:35:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dressed just like a cool samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.54,0:35:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you guys take so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.70,0:35:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because we were busy looking for\Nyour body at the bottom of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.22,0:35:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we found your Vivra card,\Nso we knew you were alive, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.40,0:35:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.52,0:35:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Inemon, how are you holding\Nup, friend? I'm getting by.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.38,0:35:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great to see you as well, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.54,0:35:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on, you filthy scab!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.00,0:35:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've rejoined your crew, Sir Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.00,0:35:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.02,0:35:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry to make\Nyou worry. Master King!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.66,0:35:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these individuals associated\Nwith Luffy Taro? Introduce me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.22,0:35:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.76,0:35:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.02,0:35:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,More than enough could ever hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.08,0:35:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your manners, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.04,0:35:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.42,0:35:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.88,0:35:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bo-Bo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.70,0:36:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nerve of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.98,0:36:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all Sir Luffy's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.96,0:36:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite charming, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.44,0:36:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These upstanding people\Nshall be assisting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.38,0:36:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It warms my heart to see Lord\NMomonosuke in such high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.28,0:36:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,captain oh it's you two how's Bepo holding\Nup he hasn't come out of the bushes
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.00,0:36:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet he's still got the runs, who doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,around here Straw Hat let's head inside
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.52,0:36:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and talk sure we've been stealing from\Nthe farm so we've got some clean food to
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.42,0:36:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat. Once you did that, the castle ruins
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.78,0:36:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,shall be repurposed as our headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.06,0:37:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,man this place is junky\Nmy apologies everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy, my brave friends, I thank\Nyou for coming to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.64,0:37:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission would not be possible\Nwithout you We're all happy to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.14,0:37:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.05,0:37:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides Momonosuke's\Nidentity, there is one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.52,0:37:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Detail I've withheld from\Nyou. And I do apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.50,0:37:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.42,0:37:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you guys and your secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.52,0:37:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not total strangers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.62,0:37:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're teammates!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.16,0:37:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I must agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.56,0:37:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends tell friends the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.60,0:37:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.28,0:37:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.16,0:37:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm about to disclose\Nmay astound you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.76,0:37:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.67,0:37:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing games!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.86,0:37:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:38:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You recall my friends,\NKanjuro and Raizo, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.44,0:38:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and you also know the three of us sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you, we five are a\Nteam. All those mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.38,0:38:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,have come to this time from the past
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait what? I'm afraid I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.58,0:38:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Together,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.62,0:38:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,we've journeyed 20 years from a land of\NWano that is quite different from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking frankly, we've\Ncost time itself to be here.
